#: angular/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A standalone Angular app (via Vite + `@analogjs/vite-plugin-angular`, no "
"Angular CLI) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and\n"
"[`@pantoken/angular`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/angular) "
"(pantoken custom elements\n"
"for Angular).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` calls `registerPantokenElements()` (from `@pantoken/"
"angular`) once at bootstrap so\n"
"  elements like `<instui-icon>` work in templates, and imports the token/"
"component CSS plus\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box).\n"
"- `src/app.component.ts` is a standalone component (`CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA` "
"lets the template\n"
"  compiler accept pantoken's custom element tags) whose template is styled "
"with `instui-*`\n"
"  classes; optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) "
"are marked with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Samostojna Angular aplikacija (prek Vite + `@analogjs/vite-plugin-angular`, "
"brez Angular CLI), oblikovana z\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"in\n"
"[`@pantoken/angular`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/angular) "
"(pantokenova oblikovana HTML-oznaka za Angular).\n"
"\n"
"## Razvoj\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Kaj je tukaj\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` pokliče `registerPantokenElements()` (iz `@pantoken/"
"angular`) enkrat ob zaganjanju, tako da elementi, kot je `<instui-icon>`, "
"delujejo v predlogah, in uvozi CSS za tokene/komponente ter `@pantoken/"
"interactions` (nastavi modal, tooltip in druge vedenjske funkcije komponent "
"takoj iz škatle).\n"
"- `src/app.component.ts` je samostojna komponenta (`CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA` "
"omogoča prevajalniku predlog, da sprejme pantokenove oznake po meri), katere "
"predloga je stilizirana s klasami `instui-*`; izbirna mesta za vstavljanje "
"(header, filters, content, trailing) so označena z `<div data-slot=\"..."
"\">`.\n"
"- Uporabite razrede, kot je `class=\"instui-button\"`, na označbah; za "
"celoten seznam razredov glejte\n"
"  [referenco komponent](https://pantoken.app/api/css).\n"
"\n"
"## Več informacij\n"
"\n"
"Oglejte si [vodnik za začetek](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started), "
"če želite več informacij.\n"

#: canvas-theme-editor/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Upload-ready assets for Canvas LMS's **Theme Editor**, plus a local preview "
"for authoring Rich\n"
"Content Editor (RCE) page templates styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `theme.css` / `theme.js` — upload these two files under **Theme Editor → "
"Advanced** in Canvas.\n"
"  They're built for the CDN provider/theme/mode you chose when scaffolding "
"(`--cdn`/`--theme`/\n"
"  `--theme-mode`; jsDelivr/rebrand/light by default) and include a loader "
"for\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up component behaviors like modal, "
"tooltip, and drilldown).\n"
"- `index.html` / `src/main.ts` — a local, TinyMCE-based editor (`npm run "
"dev`) that mirrors Canvas's\n"
"  RCE so you can author page templates against pantoken's classes before "
"copying them into Canvas.\n"
"  The page itself is built with pantoken's `wrapper` layout: click **Edit "
"theme** to open a tray\n"
"  with **Config** / **CSS** / **JS** tabs (CDN provider/theme/mode selects, "
"and syntax-highlighted,\n"
"  hand-editable copies of `theme.css`/`theme.js` that feed the live "
"preview), and the **?** button\n"
"  for full instructions. Use the **Layouts** toolbar button to start from "
"one of pantoken's bundled\n"
"  starter page layouts (hero, callout, two-column, rubric note, "
"testimonial), sourced from\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"This opens a Vite dev server with:\n"
"\n"
"- An **editor** pane (TinyMCE, matching the version/config\n"
"  [instructure/canvas-lms](https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms) itself "
"uses — see below).\n"
"  Use the **Layouts** button to load one of the bundled starter layouts "
"(this replaces the whole\n"
"  document, after a confirm, rather than inserting at the cursor), and the "
"**Source code** toggle\n"
"  to hand-edit the raw HTML in a syntax-highlighted (CodeMirror) view "
"alongside the editor, with\n"
"  the preview pane updating live as you type — unlike TinyMCE's stock `code` "
"plugin, which edits in\n"
"  a one-shot modal dialog with no live preview.\n"
"- A **preview** pane showing the editor's content with the current CSS/JS "
"tab's stylesheet/script\n"
"  applied (not just the resolved CDN URLs), wrapped to match Canvas's own "
"content-area background\n"
"  and max width — a faithful \"what this will look like once uploaded to "
"Canvas\" check, updated\n"
"  live as you type or edit the theme.\n"
"- The editor and preview panes sit in a split view you can resize by "
"dragging the divider, stack\n"
"  vertically instead of side by side, and swap the order of (drag a pane's "
"toolbar onto the other,\n"
"  or use the **Swap panes** button). Each pane has its own fullscreen "
"button.\n"
"- The **Edit theme** tray's **Config** tab holds the CDN provider/theme/mode "
"selects and\n"
"  **Download theme.css** / **Download theme.js** links; its **CSS**/**JS** "
"tabs are editable copies\n"
"  of the generated files — hand-edit them and the preview picks up your "
"changes directly. Changing\n"
"  a Config select re-generates the CSS/JS tabs unless you've already edited "
"them, in which case a\n"
"  **Regenerate from config** button appears instead of silently overwriting "
"your edit.\n"
"\n"
"## Workflow\n"
"\n"
"1. Upload `theme.css` and `theme.js` to Canvas's Theme Editor (**Advanced → "
"CSS / JavaScript**) so\n"
"   pantoken's classes are available on every page.\n"
"2. Run `npm run dev`, use **Layouts** to start from a bundled starter, and "
"edit it like you\n"
"   would in Canvas's own RCE.\n"
"3. Click **Copy HTML** and paste the result into a Canvas page's RCE (switch "
"to the HTML editor\n"
"   view first). Canvas sanitizes pasted HTML server-side — this scaffold "
"doesn't attempt to\n"
"   replicate that, so always verify the pasted result in Canvas (see \"Notes "
"on Canvas's RCE\"\n"
"   below).\n"
"\n"
"## Notes on Canvas's RCE\n"
"\n"
"The Canvas Rich Content Editor runs TinyMCE and sanitizes submitted HTML on "
"the server against an\n"
"allowlist (`gems/canvas_sanitize` in canvas-lms, kept in sync with TinyMCE's "
"own\n"
"`valid_elements`/`extended_valid_elements`). What that allowlist means for "
"templates built here:\n"
"\n"
"- `class`, `id`, `style`, `title`, `role`, and `aria-*` attributes are "
"allowed on every element —\n"
"  pantoken's `class=\"instui-*\"` styling hooks (and inline `style`, e.g. "
"for CSS anchor positioning)\n"
"  **do** survive being pasted and saved, contrary to older guidance in this "
"file. `<script>` tags\n"
"  are always stripped.\n"
"- **RCE-safe pantoken components**: static/display components — alert, view, "
"heading, text, table,\n"
"  a button-as-`<a>` (not a real `<button>`), blockquote. Stick to semantic "
"HTML pantoken already\n"
"  supports (`div`, `p`, `span`, `a`, `img`, headings, lists, tables).\n"
"- **RCE-unsafe**: anything from `@pantoken/interactions`'s behavior set — "
"modal, tooltip,\n"
"  drilldown, close-button, or any other component driven by the native "
"`popover`/`popovertarget`/\n"
"  `command`/`commandfor` attributes. Those attributes aren't in Canvas's "
"sanitizer allowlist, so\n"
"  the markup survives but the interactive behavior silently breaks the first "
"time the page is\n"
"  saved in Canvas, even with `theme.js`'s `@pantoken/interactions` loader "
"present. Real form\n"
"  elements (`input`, `form`, `button`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`) and "
"inline `<svg>` are\n"
"  stripped outright — none of the bundled starter templates use them.\n"
"\n"
"`theme.js` loads `@pantoken/interactions` from the CDN, which runs in "
"Canvas's global page scope —\n"
"useful for interactions on pages you build directly in Canvas's RCE with raw "
"HTML edits, but (per\n"
"above) any `popover`/`command`-attribute-driven markup pasted from the RCE "
"preview here won't stay\n"
"interactive once saved.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Pripravne za nalaganje sredstve za Canvas LMS-jev **Theme Editor**, plus "
"lokalni predogled za ustvarjanje predlog strani Rich\n"
"Content Editor (RCE) oblikovanih z\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Kaj je tukaj\n"
"\n"
"- `theme.css` / `theme.js` — naložite ti dve datoteki pod **Theme Editor → "
"Advanced** v Canvasu.\n"
"  Zgrajeni so za CDN ponudnika/tema/način, ki ste ga izbrali med "
"scaffoldanjem (`--cdn`/`--theme`/\n"
"  `--theme-mode`; privzeto jsDelivr/rebrand/light) in vključujejo loader za\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (poveže vedenja komponent, kot so modal, tooltip "
"in drilldown).\n"
"- `index.html` / `src/main.ts` — lokalni TinyMCE-jev urejevalnik (`npm run "
"dev`), ki odseva Canvasov\n"
"  RCE, zato lahko ustvarjate predloge strani proti pantokenovim razredom, "
"preden jih kopirate v Canvas.\n"
"  Stran sama je zgrajena z pantokenovim `wrapper` layoutom: kliknite **Edit "
"theme** za odpiranje stranskega\n"
"  panela z zavihki **Config** / **CSS** / **JS** (izbire CDN ponudnika/tema/"
"način in sintaksično označene,\n"
"  ročno ureljive kopije `theme.css`/`theme.js`, ki poganjajo živ predogled), "
"in gumb **?**\n"
"  za popolna navodila. Uporabite gumb orodne vrstice **Layouts** za začetek "
"iz ene od pantokenovih vključenih\n"
"  začetnih postavitev strani (hero, callout, two-column, rubric note, "
"testimonial), izvorno iz\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts).\n"
"\n"
"## Razvoj\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"To odpre Vite dev strežnik z:\n"
"\n"
"- Panelom **editor** (TinyMCE, ustrezna različica/konfiguracija,\n"
"  ki jo uporablja [instructure/canvas-lms](https://github.com/instructure/"
"canvas-lms) — glej spodaj).\n"
"  Uporabite gumb **Layouts** za nalaganje ene izmed vključenih začetnih "
"postavitev (to nadomesti celoten\n"
"  dokument, po potrditvi, namesto vstavljanja na mesto kurzorja), in preklop "
"**Source code** za ročno urejanje surovega HTML v sintaksično označenem "
"(CodeMirror) pogledu ob urejevalniku, pri čemer se\n"
"  predogled posodablja v živo med tipkanjem — za razliko od TinyMCE-jevega "
"privzetega `code` vtičnika, ki ureja v\n"
"  enkratnem modalnem oknu brez živega predogleda.\n"
"- Panel **preview**, ki prikazuje vsebino urejevalnika z uporabo trenutnega "
"sloga/skripte iz zavihka CSS/JS\n"
"  (ne le rešenih CDN URL-jev), zavito tako, da ustreza Canvasovemu ozadju "
"območja vsebine\n"
"  in največji širini — zvesto \"kako bo to izgledalo, ko bo naloženo v "
"Canvas\" preverjanje, posodobljeno\n"
"  v živo med tipkanjem ali urejanjem teme.\n"
"- Urejevalnik in predogled sta v razdeljenem pogledu, ki ga lahko "
"spreminjate z vlečenjem delilnika, jih zložite\n"
"  navpično namesto ob strani, in zamenjate vrstni red (povlecite orodno "
"vrstico enega panela na drugega,\n"
"  ali uporabite gumb **Swap panes**). Vsak panel ima lasten gumb za "
"celozaslonski način.\n"
"- Stranski panel **Edit theme** zavihka **Config** vsebuje izbire CDN "
"ponudnika/tema/način in\n"
"  povezave **Download theme.css** / **Download theme.js**; zavihka **CSS**/"
"**JS** sta urejljivi kopiji\n"
"  generiranih datotek — urejajte jih ročno in predogled bo neposredno "
"prevzel spremembe. Spreminjanje\n"
"  izbire v Config ponovno ustvari zavihka CSS/JS, razen če ste jih že ročno "
"spreminjali, v tem primeru se namesto tihega prepisovanja prikaže gumb "
"**Regenerate from config**.\n"
"\n"
"## Delovni tok\n"
"\n"
"1. Naložite `theme.css` in `theme.js` v Canvasov Theme Editor (**Advanced → "
"CSS / JavaScript**), da so\n"
"   pantokenovi razredi na voljo na vsaki strani.\n"
"2. Zaženite `npm run dev`, uporabite **Layouts** za začetek iz vključenega "
"starterja in ga urejajte tako,\n"
"   kot bi v Canvasovem lastnem RCE.\n"
"3. Kliknite **Copy HTML** in prilepite rezultat v RCE Canvas strani (najprej "
"se preklopite v HTML urejevalnik).\n"
"   Canvas sanitizira prilepljen HTML strežno — ta scaffold tega ne poskuša\n"
"   posnemati, zato vedno preverite prilepljeni rezultat v Canvasu (glejte "
"\"Opombe o Canvasovem RCE\"\n"
"   spodaj).\n"
"\n"
"## Opombe o Canvasovem RCE\n"
"\n"
"Canvas Rich Content Editor poganja TinyMCE in sanitizira posredovani HTML na "
"strežniku glede na\n"
"dovolilni seznam (`gems/canvas_sanitize` v canvas-lms, vzdrževan usklajen s "
"TinyMCE-jevimi lastnimi\n"
"`valid_elements`/`extended_valid_elements`). Kaj ta dovolilni seznam pomeni "
"za predloge, zgrajene tukaj:\n"
"\n"
"- Atributi `class`, `id`, `style`, `title`, `role` in `aria-*` so dovoljeni "
"na vsakem elementu —\n"
"  pantokenovi `class=\"instui-*\"` slogovni kljuki (in inline `style`, npr. "
"za pozicioniranje CSS sidra)\n"
"  **preživijo** lepljenje in shranjevanje, v nasprotju s starejšimi navodili "
"v tej datoteki. Oznake `<script>`\n"
"  se vedno odstranijo.\n"
"- **RCE-varne pantoken komponente**: statične/prikazne komponente — alert, "
"view, heading, text, table,\n"
"  gumb kot `<a>` (ne pravi `<button>`), blockquote. Držite se semantičnega "
"HTML, ki ga pantoken že\n"
"  podpira (`div`, `p`, `span`, `a`, `img`, naslovi, seznami, tabele).\n"
"- **RCE-nevarno**: karkoli iz vedenjskega nabora `@pantoken/interactions` — "
"modal, tooltip,\n"
"  drilldown, close-button ali katerakoli druga komponenta, ki jo poganjajo "
"izvorni atributi `popover`/`popovertarget`/\n"
"  `command`/`commandfor`. Ti atributi niso na Canvasovem sanitizatorjevem "
"dovolilnem seznamu, zato\n"
"  označba preživi, vendar se interaktivno vedenje tiho pokvari ob prvem "
"shranjevanju strani v Canvasu, tudi če je prisoten\n"
"  `theme.js`-jev `@pantoken/interactions` loader. Pravi obrazni elementi "
"(`input`, `form`, `button`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`) in inline "
"`<svg>`\n"
"  so popolnoma odstranjeni — nobena izmed vključenih začetnih predlog tega "
"ne uporablja.\n"
"\n"
"`theme.js` naloži `@pantoken/interactions` iz CDN, ki teče v globalnem "
"obsegu strani Canvas —\n"
"koristno za interakcije na straneh, ki jih gradite neposredno v Canvasovem "
"RCE z surovimi HTML urejanji, vendar (kot zgoraj)\n"
"katera koli označba, ki jo poganjajo atributi `popover`/`command` in je "
"prilepljena iz RCE predogleda tukaj, ne bo ostala\n"
"interaktivna, ko bo enkrat shranjena.\n"

#: components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components), Instructure's\n"
"design tokens and icons.\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `index.html` holds the actual page markup — a `wrapper`-layout shell from\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts). View source\n"
"  and edit it directly; nothing is injected by JavaScript.\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` (document defaults + focus ring), "
"`components.css`\n"
"  (`.instui-*` classes), `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, "
"and other component\n"
"  behaviors out of the box), and your own `src/style.css` — add interactive "
"behavior here.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` in `index.html` — replace their contents with "
"your own markup.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Enostavna aplikacija v TypeScriptu (prek Vite), stilizirana z\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components), Instructure-ovimi\n"
"design tokeni in ikonami.\n"
"\n"
"## Razvoj\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Kaj je tu\n"
"\n"
"- `index.html` vsebuje dejansko označevanje strani — lupina z razporeditvijo "
"`wrapper` iz\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts). Oglejte si izvorno kodo\n"
"  in jo uredite neposredno; JavaScript ničesar ne vstavi.\n"
"- `src/main.ts` uvaža `@pantoken/css` (definira vse `--instui-*` prilagojene "
"lastnosti),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` (privzete nastavitve dokumenta + obroba "
"fokusa), `components.css`\n"
"  (`.instui-*` razredi), `@pantoken/interactions` (samodejno poveže modal, "
"tooltip in drugo vedenje komponent),\n"
"  in vaš lasten `src/style.css` — tukaj dodajte interaktivno vedenje.\n"
"- Neobvezne vstavne točke (header, filters, content, trailing) so označene "
"z\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` v `index.html` — zamenjajte njihovo vsebino z "
"lastnim označevanjem.\n"
"- Uporabite razrede, kot je `class=\"instui-button\"`, pri označevanju; za "
"celoten seznam razredov glejte\n"
"  [referenco komponent](https://pantoken.app/api/css).\n"
"\n"
"## Več informacij\n"
"\n"
"Oglejte si [vodnik za HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) za več "
"informacij.\n"

#: next/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A Next.js (App Router) app styled with [`@pantoken/next`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/next),\n"
"Instructure's design tokens and icons.\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `next.config.mjs` wraps the config with `withPantoken(...)` (adds pantoken "
"to\n"
"  `transpilePackages`).\n"
"- `app/layout.tsx` imports `@pantoken/css`, which defines every `--instui-*` "
"custom\n"
"  property, at the root so it's available on every page, plus the `wrapper` "
"layout's root class on\n"
"  `<body>` and `PantokenInteractions` (a client component that loads "
"`@pantoken/interactions` —\n"
"  wires up modal, tooltip, and other component behaviors out of the box).\n"
"- `app/page.tsx` renders markup styled with `instui-*` classes; optional "
"insertion points (header,\n"
"  filters, content, trailing) are marked with `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Next.js (App Router) aplikacija, stilizirana z [`@pantoken/next`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/next),\n"
"Instructurejevi dizajn tokeni in ikone.\n"
"\n"
"## Razvoj\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Kaj je tukaj\n"
"\n"
"- `next.config.mjs` ovije konfiguracijo z `withPantoken(...)` (doda pantoken "
"v\n"
"  `transpilePackages`).\n"
"- `app/layout.tsx` uvaža `@pantoken/css`, ki definira vsako `--instui-*` po "
"meri\n"
"  lastnost na korenu, tako da je na voljo na vsaki strani, ter korenski "
"razred postavitve `wrapper` na\n"
"  `<body>` in `PantokenInteractions` (klientna komponenta, ki naloži "
"`@pantoken/interactions` —\n"
"  takoj poveže modal, tooltip in druge vedenjske mehanizme komponent).\n"
"- `app/page.tsx` upodobi markup, stiliziran z razredi `instui-*`; izbirne "
"vstavne točke (glava,\n"
"  filtri, vsebina, zaključek) so označene z `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"\n"
"## Več informacij\n"
"\n"
"Oglejte si [vodnik za začetek](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"za več informacij.\n"

#: react/README.md
