#: svelte/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A Vite + Svelte app styled with [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components)\n"
"and [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) "
"(icon action + token reads).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` calls `register()` (from `@pantoken/svelte`) once at "
"bootstrap so elements like\n"
"  `<instui-icon>` work in templates, and imports the token CSS plus "
"`@pantoken/interactions`\n"
"  (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component behaviors out of the box).\n"
"- `src/App.svelte`'s markup is styled with `instui-*` classes; optional "
"insertion points (header,\n"
"  filters, content, trailing) are marked with `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Vite + Svelte aplikacija, stilizirana z [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components)\n"
"in [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) "
"(dejanje ikon + branje tokenov).\n"
"\n"
"## Razvoj\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Kaj je tukaj\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` pokliče `register()` (iz `@pantoken/svelte`) enkrat ob "
"zagonu, tako da elementi, kot je\n"
"  `<instui-icon>`, delujejo v predlogah, in uvozi token CSS ter `@pantoken/"
"interactions`\n"
"  (samodejno poveže modal, tooltip in drugo vedenje komponent).\n"
"- Označevanje `src/App.svelte` je stilizirano z razredi `instui-*`; izbirna "
"mesta za vstavljanje (glava,\n"
"  filtri, vsebina, zadnji) so označena z `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Uporabite razrede, kot je `class=\"instui-button\"`, v označevanju; "
"poglejte\n"
"  [referenco komponent](https://pantoken.app/api/css) za celoten seznam "
"razredov.\n"
"\n"
"## Več\n"
"\n"
"Oglejte si [vodnik za začetek](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"za več informacij.\n"

